---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { attraction } from '../config/site';

interface Props {
  /** band: ヒーロー直下の横帯 / card: パネル表示 */
  variant?: 'band' | 'card';
  class?: string;
}

const { variant = 'band', class: className = '' } = Astro.props;
const { rating, fullName, shortName, categoryLabel, city } = attraction;

const countLabel = new Intl.NumberFormat('ja-JP').format(rating.count);
const valueLabel = rating.value.toFixed(1);
const fullStars = Math.floor(rating.value);
const hasHalf = rating.value - fullStars >= 0.5;
const emptyStars = 5 - fullStars - (hasHalf ? 1 : 0);

const ariaLabel = `${fullName}のGoogle マップ評価は5点満点中${valueLabel}、クチコミ${countLabel}件（${rating.syncedAt}時点の同期値）`;
---

<div class:list={['paper-panel overflow-hidden', className]} data-google-rating>
  <div class="awning-stripe h-1.5"></div>

  <div class:list={[variant === 'band' ? 'grid gap-6 p-6 md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] md:items-center md:gap-10 md:p-7' : 'grid gap-6 p-7 md:p-9']}>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="font-serif text-[3.2rem] font-semibold leading-none text-harbor">{valueLabel}</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[0.6rem] font-extrabold tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">/ 5.0</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-gold" role="img" aria-label={ariaLabel}>
          {Array.from({ length: fullStars }).map(() => (
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 2.4 2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.7 1.2 6.6L12 17.6 6.1 20.7l1.2-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.9L12 2.4Z"/></svg>
          ))}
          {hasHalf && (
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <defs><linearGradient id="half-star-grad"><stop offset="50%" stop-color="currentColor"/><stop offset="50%" stop-color="transparent"/></linearGradient></defs>
              <path d="m12 2.4 2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.7 1.2 6.6L12 17.6 6.1 20.7l1.2-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.9L12 2.4Z" fill="url(#half-star-grad)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            </svg>
          )}
          {Array.from({ length: emptyStars }).map(() => (
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 2.4 2.9 6.1 6.6.9-4.8 4.7 1.2 6.6L12 17.6 6.1 20.7l1.2-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.9L12 2.4Z"/></svg>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-bold text-ink"><span class="font-serif text-lg">{countLabel}</span> 件のクチコミ</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[0.68rem] font-bold tracking-[0.06em] text-ink-soft">{categoryLabel} · {city}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-line md:border-l md:pl-9">
      <p class="text-[0.72rem] leading-6 text-ink-soft">
        評価とクチコミ数は Google マップ（Google Maps）のユーザー評価を同期 ・ {rating.syncedAt} ・{' '}
        <a
          href={rating.sourceUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"
          class="font-bold text-harbor underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-vermilion"
        >
          Google マップですべてのクチコミを見る↗
        </a>
      </p>
      {variant === 'card' && (
        <p class="mt-2 text-[0.68rem] leading-6 text-ink-soft">
          Google マップのユーザー評価より同期。同期時期 {rating.syncedAt}。著作権は各投稿者および Google マップに帰属します。
        </p>
      )}
    </div>

    <div class:list={[variant === 'band' ? 'md:justify-self-end' : '']}>
      <a
        href={rating.sourceUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"
        class="button-primary w-full justify-center md:w-auto"
      >
        Google マップで全てのクチコミを見る
        <Icon name="arrow" size={16} />
      </a>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[0.64rem] leading-5 text-ink-soft">
        {shortName}（{fullName}）· {rating.sourceName}のユーザー投稿に基づく参考値です。内容は日々変動します。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
